{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Platformer RPG about Felix the goblin who posses a demonic power of reincarnation! With it he must save his kind from eradication!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game dying is good \ud83d\udc4dDeath lets you upgrade skills to be reborn stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Gameplay:\u00a0</i></strong><i>Platformer RPG with combat that feels like early game Terraria.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/52c031de8c89c221f1731deb217c1fa2.avif?t=1759452522\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as <strong>Felix,</strong>\u00a0a goblin fighting to protect the last of his kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/d06e52976e5ae7e936e3f2be61e8a0db.avif?t=1759452522\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goblin camp let's you prepare for battles by changing your weapons, gear and charms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/8668c0f9d0c4c7cc9d951e8a3a559fe4.avif?t=1759452522\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Obor </strong>is\u00a0Felix's mentor. He is a legendary goblin warrior with wit and wisdom.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3299850/extras/1f4f229f6b821f3bafa6989b952f743b.avif?t=1759452522\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evelyn </strong>sells magic charms and helps Felix stay sane.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cla